haroune.me — personal site and CV for Haroune Mohammedi
========================================================

This repository contains a mix of forked open-source code and original
personal content. Different parts have different licensing:

1. LaTeX class file: cv/PlushCV.cls
   Licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
   Forked from PlushCV (https://github.com/sansquoi/PlushCV), itself a
   fork of Deedy-Resume (https://github.com/deedy/Deedy-Resume).
   The current file is substantially modified (multilingual support via
   polyglossia, language class options, RTL/Arabic scaffolding).

2. Bundled fonts: cv/fonts/
   Each family ships under its own license — typically SIL Open Font
   License 1.1 (Inter, Source Sans Pro, Office Code Pro). See the
   per-family license files (where present) inside each directory.

3. Icon set: cv/icons/
   PNG icons from icons8.com (Carbon Copy style). Licensed for personal
   use as bundled here; consult icons8.com for redistribution terms.

4. Resume content and orchestration:
   - cv/resume_en.tex, cv/resume_fr.tex
   - site/template.mjs, site/css/, site/js/, site/locales/, site/public/
   - build.mjs, Makefile, CLAUDE.md, README.md
   - Generated PDFs (haroune_mohammedi_cv_*.pdf)
